# A delayed triggered ability has the text of the spell that created it as that spell resolved (CR 603.7d, 612.1, 608.2):
# Bot1 casts High Tide and, in response, Magical Hack changes "Island" in it to "Swamp". Once High Tide has resolved and
# left the stack, its ability watches Swamps: Bot1's Swamp makes {B}{U} - the additional mana is still {U}, a mana symbol
# being no word (CR 612.2) - and an Island makes {U} alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Swamp
Island
High Tide
Magical Hack
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.High Tide.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Magical Hack.Cast(High Tide)
Bot1.Modes(Island)
Bot1.Modes(Swamp)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{B}
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#3.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{U}{B}

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = High Tide; Magical Hack
Delayed = High Tide
